{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","旋风斩"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","挥动武器，每秒对邻格敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在4秒内挥动武器高速旋转，每秒对周围1格的敌人造成110% + 15% ATK的伤害。技能释放期间布鲁特斯处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":55,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至120% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","技能释放期间布鲁特斯还会免疫所有伤害，并且不消耗布鲁特斯其他技能免疫伤害效果的持续时间。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至130% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至140% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","狮吼"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","怒吼，嘲讽附近的敌人，并降低他们的护甲。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","发出怒吼，嘲讽周围2格内的敌人1.5 + 0.5秒，并使他们在9秒内下降15%的护甲。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","下降护甲的幅度提升至20%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","下降护甲的幅度提升至25%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","下降护甲的幅度提升至30%。"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","不屈"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","免疫首次最后一击，并且在数秒内免疫物理与魔法伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯首次受到最后一击时，免疫这次伤害，并且在5 + 1秒内免疫所有伤害，并处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"keyword:fatal"},{"start":41,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","还会在免疫伤害的期间内增加25点生命汲取与25%的攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","还会在免疫伤害的期间内增加35点生命汲取与30%的攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","还会在免疫伤害的期间内增加35点生命汲取与35%的攻击力。"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身生命汲取，释放大招时生命汲取进一步提高。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的生命汲取提升10点，释放终极技能时，自身生命汲取额外提升5点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的生命汲取提升13点，释放终极技能时，自身生命汲取额外提升7点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的生命汲取提升16点，释放终极技能时，自身生命汲取额外提升8点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","顺劈斩"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","每承受来自邻格一定次数的物理攻击，便可以大力顺劈，对面前小范围内的敌人造成大量伤害，附带生命汲取效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每承受10次来自1格以内的物理伤害，便可以发动一次威力巨大的“顺劈斩”。“顺劈斩”对前方1格扇形区域内的敌人造成200% ATK外加目标12%最大生命值的伤害（总伤害不超过750% ATK），附带30%的生命汲取效果。布鲁特斯每5秒至多发动1次顺劈斩。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":56,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":86,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","顺劈斩的伤害提升至230% ATK外加目标最大生命值的12%（总伤害不超过780% ATK）。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":37,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","顺劈斩的释放不再受时间间隔的约束，每承受10次来自1格以内的物理伤害，便可以发动一次威力巨大的“顺劈斩”。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","顺劈斩的伤害提升至260% ATK外加目标最大生命值的12%（总伤害不超过780% ATK）。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":37,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“不屈”持续时间时间增加。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“不屈”免疫所有伤害和霸体状态的持续时间增加1秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","岩峦之刃"]]}